                        "review": "this game feels like it put \"The Surge 1\" in a blender with every other game in the world, and the mix that came out has every bug and error of every game in the world\n\n\nbut seriously though, this game lacks any coherent identity in terms of mechanics, and the audio-visual feedback is extremely lacking, \n\nthe dialogue is very cliche, corny, and horrendously boring, as is the story \n\ni played the surge 1 btw, it was better cause it was simply more coherent",
